    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Description/Metric Definitions'>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/Foodora/workbooks/APACSalesCapabilityReport/DescriptionMetricDefinitions?rev=' id='DescriptionMetricDefinitions' path='/t/Foodora/workbooks/APACSalesCapabilityReport' revision='' site='Foodora' />
      <style />
      <size maxheight='1000' maxwidth='1600' minheight='1000' minwidth='1600' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone fixed-size='242' h='10600' id='3' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='10500' x='500' y='800'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='18'>foodpanda</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#d60265' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='10600' id='5' type-v2='text' w='88500' x='11000' y='800'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='15'>     DESCRIPTION / METRIC DEFINITIONS</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              <format attr='background-color' value='#e6e6e6' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='80100' id='6' type-v2='text' w='99000' x='500' y='11400'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>Activations &amp; Headcount Deep Dive</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' underline='true'>Objective</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>This dashboard aims to track overall activations, headcount and productivity numbers for all Restaurant sellers (Field Representative + Telesales agents).</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' underline='true'>How to use this dashboard?</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Section 1: Sales Representative Monthly Summary</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>- This tab outlines total activations, headcount and productivity for the current month by default.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>- A monthly view of these metrics is presented after the topline metrics to visualise trends broken down by user type or vendor grade</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>- A detailed view is presented at the end of section 1 which can be used for deep dive downloads. This sheet can be downloaded at &apos;[DOWNLOAD] Sales Rep Monthly Summary&apos;</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Section 2: Targets &amp; Rep Quality</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>- This tab outlines current achievements vs targets for the current month by default.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>- The leaderboard section determines performance of reps based on quality and quantity of activations.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>Section 3: User Tagging Hygiene</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>This section aims to highlight users who have potentially incorrect fields populated on Salesforce. Fields should be corrected via raising a jira ticket &amp; the updated data will be reflected in the next day. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>This section will be removed eventually when the salesforce fields of all sellers are corrected.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' underline='true'>Definitions</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>1. Total headcount</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>All sellers (field reps + telesales agents) under payroll. Includes active sellers on probation, identified by having the following fields on Salesforce:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>      - Job vertical: Restaurant </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' italic='true'>(+ Hybrid for Pakistan only)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' italic='true'>      - </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>Central job role: Field Sales Representative </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' italic='true'>OR</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'> Telesales Representative</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>      - Active status: TRUE on Salesforce at point of report date.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>2. Active headcount</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>All sellers that are actively contributing. These sellers are identified by having the following fields on Salesforce:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>     - Job vertical: Restaurant </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' italic='true'>(+ Hybrid for Pakistan only)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>     - Central job role: Field Sales Representative </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' italic='true'>OR</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'> Telesales Representative</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>     - Active status: TRUE on Salesforce at point of report date.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>     - Account age: &gt; =60 days at point of report date. (exclude sellers on probation)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>     - Job Title: Does not contain the word  &quot;Contractor&quot; (sellers who are not permanent employees)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>     - Total activations &gt;= 2 (excludes sellers on sabbatical / long leave)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>Æ    </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>3. Productivity </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>Total activations / Total active headcount. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>APAC average is calculated by taking total activations in APAC / Total active headcount in APAC.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>*Note that only activations made by active headcount base is considered for all productivity calculations.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000'>For more detailed information, click on the documentation icon on the top right.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='7700' id='9' type-v2='empty' w='99000' x='500' y='91500'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone alt-text='Productivity &amp; Headcount Guide' h='5000' id='7' is-centered='0' is-scaled='1' param='Image/Documentation icon.png' type-v2='bitmap' url='https://docs.google.com/document/d/11bnsMzvfTOlMZFK02VZmGGK3PnjV7ZQobIC9nVadtQE/edit' w='4375' x='94000' y='2300' />
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='4800' id='8' type-v2='text' w='10063' x='90125' y='6700'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Click for more detailed documentation!</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
