                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#d50065' fontsize='15'> Overall Productivity</run>
                    <run>
   Default filters for active representatives as per productivity definition, ie:
   1. Active on Salesforce as of report month
   2. Have at least 2 activations in the report month (&gt;=2 activations)
   3. Have Salesforce account age &gt;=60 as of last day of report month
   4. Central job role = Field Sales Representative / Telesales Representative
   5. Restaurant job vertical

</run>
